[{"title":"【工具自荐】小巧的markdown、书签、代码管理的web端，可使用SQLite存储数据","issueNumber":"3649","datetime":"2023-11-20T23:42:57Z","author":"crackeer","body":"git地址：https://github.com/crackeer/markdown-web\r\n1. 前端使用jQuery、vue、bootstrap3，朴实、简单、可靠\r\n2. 前端纯静态，无需编译，也就有了定制的可能\r\n3. header.js动态load所有依赖lib文件，专注单页功能实现","html":"<p dir=\"auto\">git地址：<a href=\"https://github.com/crackeer/markdown-web\">https://github.com/crackeer/markdown-web</a></p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>前端使用jQuery、vue、bootstrap3，朴实、简单、可靠</li>\n<li>前端纯静态，无需编译，也就有了定制的可能</li>\n<li>header.js动态load所有依赖lib文件，专注单页功能实现</li>\n</ol>"},{"title":"【文章自荐】State of GPT: A Programmer's Perspective","issueNumber":"3260","datetime":"2023-07-11T10:57:51Z","author":"houminz","body":"从程序员的角度理解 GPT 及其相关技术的最新进展 Houmin In The Loop\r\n\r\nhttps://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ddIG-OSKPZjlU0KfGa1MHQ\r\n\r\n欢迎访问公众号 In The Loop \r\n![image](https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/assets/16812977/98b05343-43e0-4a48-8275-ff716e5b73f4)\r\n\r\n或者访问我的博客，欢迎交流与指正\r\n- https://loop.houmin.site/context/state-of-gpt/","html":"<p dir=\"auto\">从程序员的角度理解 GPT 及其相关技术的最新进展 Houmin In The Loop</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ddIG-OSKPZjlU0KfGa1MHQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ddIG-OSKPZjlU0KfGa1MHQ</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">欢迎访问公众号 In The Loop<br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/16812977/252642806-98b05343-43e0-4a48-8275-ff716e5b73f4.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..ZfSUI0-vWkLKfo6Fm21vx-IYZnDocfMYzlpHHZWY4N0\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/16812977/252642806-98b05343-43e0-4a48-8275-ff716e5b73f4.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..ZfSUI0-vWkLKfo6Fm21vx-IYZnDocfMYzlpHHZWY4N0\" alt=\"image\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">或者访问我的博客，欢迎交流与指正</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://loop.houmin.site/context/state-of-gpt/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://loop.houmin.site/context/state-of-gpt/</a></li>\n<